  <article class="drow">
    <div class="dtext"><span class="sub">4.1</span><h3>Design for building technology</h3><p>Interfaces and visualizations for my own tools: the generalizable web user interface for deploying building energy management systems (<a href="#p-tm4715">ORNL/TM-2026/4715</a>), and the Comfit digital twin dashboard, which shows IoT sensor data on a BIM model in real time.</p></div>
