  <article class="drow">
    <div class="dtext"><span class="sub">4.2</span><h3>Computational and generative design</h3><p>Parametric modeling in Grasshopper, and a generative-design study at Autodesk that coupled design generation with natural ventilation simulation in EnergyPlus. The study resulted in two U.S. patent applications and a SimBuild 2024 paper.</p><p class="pat">US20250238578A1<br>US20250238566A1</p></div>
